      "writtenOn": "2026-08-31T09:22:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As previously discussed, this is an infra patch to enable state sensor in pldmd.\nThis function helps creating D-Bus interface on D-Bus object for each existing PLDM entity.\n\nHowever, not every PLDM entity will get their D-Bus object created. Currently pldmd only creates D-Bus object for certain shortlisted entity type.\n\nIn addition, to create D-Bus interface on the D-Bus object owned by each entity we need appropriate PDI for the mapping. \n\nCurrently we don\u0027t have enough PDI to covers all of the state set type defined in DSP0249. Only some shortlisted PDI are able to do so.\n\nI keep the effort of enabling more entity type and PDI in the next few patches in the relation chains. Please check them for more details.\n\nThanks!",
